==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{amino acid}} A [[sulphur]]-[[containing]] [[essential amino acid]], C<sub>5</sub>H<sub>11</sub>NO<sub>2</sub>S, found in most [[protein]]; it is [[lipotropic]].

